{"unit_id": "tag:01VL:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n为得出这个引理（lemma）的正确逆命题（converse），我们问：给定一个相对丰沛（relatively ample）的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）<MATH_0001>，是否存在整数（integer）<MATH_0002>，使得<MATH_0003>相对极丰沛（relatively very ample）？一般而言，这并不成立。有几个因素可使这一断言不成立：\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> 即使<MATH_0004>是仿射（affine）的，也可能没有任何有限（finite）整数（integer）<MATH_0005>满足要求，因为<MATH_0006>并非有限型（finite type）的，见例<REF_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0004> 基底（base）不拟紧（quasi-compact）时，即使<MATH_0007>是有限型（finite type）的，结论也可能不成立。具体而言，给定一个域（field）<MATH_0008>，存在一个概形（scheme）<MATH_0009>，它在<MATH_0010>上是有限型（finite type）的，并且有一个丰沛（ample）的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）<MATH_0011>，使得<MATH_0012>的张量幂（tensor power）中，次数最小的极丰沛（very ample）者是第<MATH_0013>次幂（power）。见例<REF_0002>。\n取<MATH_0014>为诸概形（schemes）<MATH_0015>的不交并（disjoint union），并将其映射（mapping）到<MATH_0016>的各个副本的不交并（disjoint union），便得到一个例子。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n我们的逆命题（converse）见下文的引理（Lemma）<REF_0003>。在证明它之前，我们先做一些准备工作。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "converse", "target_term": "逆命题"}, {"source_term": "relatively ample", "target_term": "相对丰沛"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "relatively very ample", "target_term": "相对极丰沛"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "tensor power", "target_term": "张量幂"}, {"source_term": "very ample", "target_term": "极丰沛"}, {"source_term": "power", "target_term": "次幂"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并"}, {"source_term": "mapping", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并"}, {"source_term": "converse", "target_term": "逆命题"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "所讨论其逆命题的引理。"}, {"source_term": "converse", "target_term": "逆命题", "context": "将原引理的条件与结论对调所得的命题。"}, {"source_term": "relatively ample", "target_term": "相对丰沛", "context": "给定的可逆层具有的相对性质。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "限定开头给定的层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "开头给定的对象。"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数", "context": "开头问句中幂指数的取值类型。"}, {"source_term": "relatively very ample", "target_term": "相对极丰沛", "context": "开头问句中要求该幂具有的相对性质。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "第一个障碍所考虑的条件。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "限定第一个障碍中所考虑的整数。"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数", "context": "第一个障碍中可能不存在满足要求的该类指数。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "第一个障碍中缺失的性质。"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底", "context": "第二个障碍中讨论拟紧性的对象。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "第二个障碍中基底缺失的性质。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "第二个障碍中仍可满足的条件。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "构造所给定的对象。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "构造中在给定域上取的对象。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "所取概形在给定域上的性质。"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛", "context": "所取概形上的可逆层具有的性质。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "限定所取概形上的丰沛层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "所取概形上的对象。"}, {"source_term": "tensor power", "target_term": "张量幂", "context": "用来比较何时达到极丰沛的各次幂。"}, {"source_term": "very ample", "target_term": "极丰沛", "context": "比较各张量幂时要求的性质。"}, {"source_term": "power", "target_term": "次幂", "context": "满足极丰沛要求的最小次幂。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "不交并中列出的源端对象。"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并", "context": "由诸概形组成的源端对象。"}, {"source_term": "mapping", "target_term": "映射", "context": "源端不交并到目标端不交并的映射。"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并", "context": "由各个副本组成的目标端对象。"}, {"source_term": "converse", "target_term": "逆命题", "context": "下文引理给出的逆命题版本。"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "文末所引用的下文引理。"}], "notes": []}
